  descriptionHeader: Firewall Defender
  description: "Your server is under attack! Different data packets are flowing in,
    but the automatic security systems are offline.\n\n<b>\u2022 Click on suspicious
    packets</b> to block them before they reach the server.  \n<b>\u2022 Let safe
    packets through</b> so the server can keep running smoothly.\n\n<b>Be careful:</b> 
    \n - If you block too many safe packets, the server will lose connections.  \n
    - If too many dangerous packets get through, the server will be compromised.\n\n<b>Keep
    the server stable and secure for as long as you can!</b>"
